---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/navigation/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/navigation/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service">
  <Navbar lang="en" />
  <main class="min-h-screen pt-32 pb-12 px-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none font-body">
      <h1 class="font-display">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p>Last updated: July 12, 2026</p>
      <h2 class="font-display">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By accessing and using OutATL, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display">2. Accuracy of Information</h2>
      <p>OutATL is a community directory and curation hub. While we strive to keep business hours, event lineups, and venue details accurate, we cannot guarantee their real-time accuracy. Please verify details directly with the venues.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display">3. External Links and Curation</h2>
      <p>Our platform contains links to external websites and embedded content from third-party creators. OutATL does not endorse or assume responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites or services.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>All original content, branding, and curation organization on OutATL is the property of OutATL. Third-party logos, imagery, and embedded content remain the property of their respective owners.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display">5. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance of the modified terms.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>
